  "description": "Enhanced cross-platform C# library for UMAP dimensionality reduction with unique features: 27D embedding support (1D-50D), multiple distance metrics (Euclidean, Cosine, Manhattan, Correlation, Hamming), real-time progress reporting with callbacks, complete model persistence and authentic transform capabilities. Based on proven uwot implementation with production-ready enhancements not available in other C# UMAP libraries.",
  "id": "UMAPuwotSharp",
